      "side": 1,
      "message": "My strong hunch is that this is an `kAlpha_8_SkColorType` texture which is created as R8 internally, and Graphite is treating it as red instead of as alpha. We see a very similar effect on the GM_threshold_rt slide: https://osscs.corp.google.com/skia/skia/+/main:gm/runtimeshader.cpp;l\u003d95;drc\u003ddeac56e45256d2df9a03fec48c10e819c20dd322\n\nIt\u0027s definitely not color space management and it doesn\u0027t look like a local matrix issue either.",
